// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  RoadWatch — iOS Google Maps SDK key
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  1. Copy this file to `Maps.xcconfig` (same folder).
//  2. Paste your iOS-restricted key after the `=`.
//  3. Create the key in Google Cloud Console restricted to "Maps SDK for iOS"
//     and your app's bundle identifier (see ios/Runner.xcodeproj PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER).
//
//  `Maps.xcconfig` is git-ignored, so your key never lands in version control.
//  When the value is empty the app simply skips the native map SDK and falls
//  back to its list-based map view — nothing breaks.
//
//  You must ALSO pass the key to Dart so the UI switches from the list
//  fallback to a real map:
//    flutter build ipa --dart-define=GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<ios-key>
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
